DECISIONS 213, CODEGEN.md §2.1: a go emit whose mode check refused has no mode, so its @reload value is not refused for it (no E8202).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A place.
record Place {
  /// Its key.
  id: String
}

/// Every place.
@reload let places: [Place] keyed by id = [{ id: "home" }]

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: zzmode }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8009]  a/a.canon:12:51
  invalid mode zzmode for emit go: expected one of baked, embedded, data, types

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
